  "body": "This is an attempt at fixing https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/145 concretely. The three commits are meant to be reviewed independently and landed separately.\n\nWithout this, the spec is not only imprecise (using \"in a document\" instead of \"in a document tree\") but also wrong, as it's important that \"child browsing context\" use \"connected\" since it defines various important concepts like \"unit of related similar-origin browsing contexts\". A new concept of \"document-tree child browsing context\" is introduced for the named/indexed property cases.\n",
